{"t":"Order of the Lion","s":"order-of-the-lion-3a67c","k":"outro","i":"assets/wiki/Lion_Archer_820f21.gif","html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><p>The <b>Order of the Lion</b> is one of the Ancient Orders of King Xenom, currently led by <a href=\"#/wiki/Kesar%20the%20Younger\">Kesar the Younger</a>. It was founded by Kesar Etzel after a dispute within the Order of the Falcon between he and his siblings <a href=\"#/wiki/Grand%20Master%20Oberon\">Oberon</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Scarlett%20Etzel\">Scarlett Etzel</a> (who created the Order of the Cobra). Their headquarters are in <a href=\"#/wiki/Bounac\">Bounac</a>. There is a <a href=\"#/wiki/The%20Order%20of%20the%20Lion%20Quest\">quest</a> of the same name.\n</p><p>They are under attack by knights which desire to take control of the order, led by <a href=\"#/wiki/Fugue\">Fugue</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Drume\">Drume</a> and supported by the Order of the Falcon.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Members_of_the_Order_of_the_Lion\">Members of the Order of the Lion</span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Loyal_Members\">Loyal Members</span></h3>\n<p>These Lion members are loyal to their current leader and peaceful. They do not attack players.\n</p><p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div><table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">Exp</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">HP</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Max. Damage</th><th style=\"font-size: small;\">Loot</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Lion%20Archer\"><img alt=\"Lion Archer\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Lion_Archer_820f21.gif\" width=\